{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 0, "start_seconds": 0.0, "end_seconds": 3.9200000762939453, "text": "If you had to guess the most radioactive place on Earth, where would you pick?", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 1, "start_seconds": 3.9200000762939453, "end_seconds": 8.640000343322754, "text": "Let's use this banana for scale, because bananas are high in potassium,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 2, "start_seconds": 8.640000343322754, "end_seconds": 13.359999656677246, "text": "and around 0.001% of potassium atoms are naturally radioactive.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 3, "start_seconds": 13.359999656677246, "end_seconds": 15.520000457763672, "text": "Which means, every time you eat a banana,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 4, "start_seconds": 15.520000457763672, "end_seconds": 19.440000534057617, "text": "you're ingesting around 50 micrograms of radioactive material.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 5, "start_seconds": 19.440000534057617, "end_seconds": 23.600000381469727, "text": "Now at that rate, you would need to eat around 20 million bananas all at once", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 6, "start_seconds": 23.600000381469727, "end_seconds": 25.84000015258789, "text": "to get a lethal dose of radiation.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 7, "start_seconds": 25.84000015258789, "end_seconds": 30.239999771118164, "text": "Though by that point, I would say the radiation would be the least of your concerns.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 8, "start_seconds": 30.239999771118164, "end_seconds": 32.31999969482422, "text": "Now just hanging out in a park for a day,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 9, "start_seconds": 32.31999969482422, "end_seconds": 36.2400016784668, "text": "you're exposed to around 65 bananas worth of background radiation", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 10, "start_seconds": 36.2400016784668, "end_seconds": 37.84000015258789, "text": "from the soil and space.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 11, "start_seconds": 37.84000015258789, "end_seconds": 40.08000183105469, "text": "If you get in a plane, as you climb higher,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 12, "start_seconds": 40.08000183105469, "end_seconds": 44.08000183105469, "text": "you get less and less atmosphere above you to shield you from cosmic rays.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 13, "start_seconds": 44.08000183105469, "end_seconds": 49.119998931884766, "text": "Which means a five-hour flight from New York to LA equates to around 150 bananas.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 14, "start_seconds": 49.119998931884766, "end_seconds": 52.15999984741211, "text": "What if you spent 24 hours walking around Chernobyl?", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 15, "start_seconds": 52.15999984741211, "end_seconds": 55.36000061035156, "text": "Well, that's the equivalent of eating 1,200 bananas.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 16, "start_seconds": 55.36000061035156, "end_seconds": 57.68000030517578, "text": "Up above our atmosphere on the ISS,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 17, "start_seconds": 57.68000030517578, "end_seconds": 62.79999923706055, "text": "astronauts are blasted with over 4,300 bananas worth of radiation every single day.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 18, "start_seconds": 62.79999923706055, "end_seconds": 67.44000244140625, "text": "But even that is not the highest radiation dose a person is likely to receive.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 19, "start_seconds": 67.44000244140625, "end_seconds": 70.80000305175781, "text": "No, that award goes to your everyday smoker.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 20, "start_seconds": 70.80000305175781, "end_seconds": 74.4800033569336, "text": "Because tobacco contains highly radioactive polonium and lead,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 21, "start_seconds": 74.4800033569336, "end_seconds": 78.0, "text": "and when smoked, those atoms get directly into your lungs,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 22, "start_seconds": 78.0, "end_seconds": 82.72000122070312, "text": "firing radiation into your sensitive tissues at levels equivalent to being on the ISS.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 23, "start_seconds": 82.72000122070312, "end_seconds": 85.5999984741211, "text": "The difference is, astronauts get to go home,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 24, "start_seconds": 85.5999984741211, "end_seconds": 89.19999694824219, "text": "whereas smokers receive that dose day in and day out for decades.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "h2KFNdLqAiU", "segment_index": 25, "start_seconds": 89.19999694824219, "end_seconds": 91.91999816894531, "text": "Subscribe for more banana-based reasons not to smoke.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
